1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Learning without direction can waste time and hide the skills a career goal demands.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
EduPath turns that challenge into a personalized path from learning to career success.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:21,000
On the dashboard, learners can see their target role, completed tasks, study time,
skill-gap closure, and the next best action.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Weekly activity and priority gaps bring the plan into focus.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Start with a learner profile: current skills, experience, preferred learning style,
available study time, and career goal.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
EduPath uses this information to tailor recommendations. In this demo, Alex is working
toward an AI Engineer role.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:02,000
The skill-gap view compares listed skills and evidence with target-role competencies.
Each item shows a current level, required level, priority,

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:15,000
and suggested action. These demo-mode insights help the learner decide what to study first.

9
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Generate a learning path to organize the gaps into learning phases, then review the weekly
plan for daily learning, practice, projects, and assessment.

10
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:40,000
The structure turns a broad career goal into manageable work that fits the learner's schedule.

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Ask the AI Learning Assistant a focused question, such as how to learn transformer attention
and plan a study session.

12
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Here, responses are clearly marked as demo-mode guidance because no live LLM provider
is configured. Add a provider key in the backend to enable real AI.

13
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Practice Lab generates a question, records the learner's score, and updates progress.
A low score can trigger prerequisite review,

14
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:30,000
while task completion and assessments feed the progress summary. Demo information is temporary;
this deployment does not report a connected database.

15
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
EduPath makes learning more focused, measurable, and actionable.
Learn smarter. Grow faster. Achieve more.

16
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Visit the live product and explore the open-source project on GitHub.
